<title>UK: Million barrels Brent sells at Nov +7 cents.</title>
<headline>Million barrels Brent sells at Nov +7 cents.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two Brent cargoes traded on Thursday at slightly higher values of November Brent plus seven cents.</p>
<p>A million barrels of Oct 7-9 loading Brent was sold by a UK major to a European refiner.</p>
<p>Brent for early October sold on Wednesday at Nov plus six cents and November parity.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 8060</p>
</text>
